<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Ngân sách - MoneyCare</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link href="css/site.css" rel="stylesheet">
</head>
<body>
<div class="app">
  <aside class="sidebar">

    <a class="brand"
       asp-controller="Home"
       asp-action="Index">
        <i class="bi bi-wallet2"></i> MoneyCare
    </a>

    <a class="item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index">
        <i class="bi bi-grid-1x2-fill"></i> Tổng quan
    </a>

    <a class="item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="GiaoDich">
        <i class="bi bi-arrow-left-right"></i> Thu chi
    </a>

    <a class="item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="NganSach">
        <i class="bi bi-pie-chart-fill"></i> Ngân sách
    </a>

    <a class="item" asp-controller="Home" asp-action="TietKiem">
        <i class="bi bi-piggy-bank-fill"></i> Tiết kiệm
    </a>

</aside>
  <main class="content">
    <h1 class="page-title">Ngân sách tháng 10/2026</h1>
    <p class="page-sub">Hạn mức là kế hoạch chi tiêu, không trừ vào số dư cho đến khi bạn thực chi.</p>

    <div class="box mb-4">
      <h2>Đặt hạn mức</h2>
      <form method="post" action="#" class="row g-3 align-items-end">
        <div class="col-md-5"><label class="form-label">Danh mục chi</label>
          <select class="form-select" name="MaDanhMuc" required><option>Ăn uống</option><option>Phòng trọ</option><option>Điện, nước, mạng</option><option>Đi lại</option></select></div>
        <div class="col-md-4"><label class="form-label">Hạn mức (đ)</label>
          <input type="number" class="form-control" name="HanMuc" min="1" required></div>
        <div class="col-md-3"><button type="submit" class="btn btn-main w-100">Lưu hạn mức</button></div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6"><div class="box">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="ico ico-food"><i class="bi bi-cup-hot-fill"></i></span>
          <div class="flex-grow-1"><b>Ăn uống</b><div class="text-secondary small">Hạn mức 2.000.000đ</div></div>
          <span class="badge-soft soft-ok">Trong hạn mức</span></div>
        <div class="progress mb-2"><div class="progress-bar bar-ok" style="width:40%"></div></div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small"><span class="text-secondary">Đã chi 800.000đ (40%)</span><b>Còn lại 1.200.000đ</b></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6"><div class="box">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="ico ico-home"><i class="bi bi-house-door-fill"></i></span>
          <div class="flex-grow-1"><b>Phòng trọ</b><div class="text-secondary small">Hạn mức 1.800.000đ</div></div>
          <span class="badge-soft soft-ok">Trong hạn mức</span></div>
        <div class="progress mb-2"><div class="progress-bar bar-ok" style="width:56%"></div></div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small"><span class="text-secondary">Đã chi 1.000.000đ (56%)</span><b>Còn lại 800.000đ</b></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6"><div class="box">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="ico ico-bill"><i class="bi bi-lightning-charge-fill"></i></span>
          <div class="flex-grow-1"><b>Điện, nước, mạng</b><div class="text-secondary small">Hạn mức 500.000đ</div></div>
          <span class="badge-soft soft-ok">Trong hạn mức</span></div>
        <div class="progress mb-2"><div class="progress-bar bar-ok" style="width:40%"></div></div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small"><span class="text-secondary">Đã chi 200.000đ (40%)</span><b>Còn lại 300.000đ</b></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="col-md-6"><div class="box">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-3 mb-3"><span class="ico ico-move"><i class="bi bi-bus-front-fill"></i></span>
          <div class="flex-grow-1"><b>Đi lại (ví dụ cảnh báo)</b><div class="text-secondary small">Hạn mức 500.000đ</div></div>
          <span class="badge-soft soft-warn">Sắp hết</span></div>
        <div class="progress mb-2"><div class="progress-bar bar-warn" style="width:85%"></div></div>
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between small"><span class="text-secondary">Đã chi 425.000đ (85%)</span><b>Còn lại 75.000đ</b></div>
      </div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-secondary small mt-4"><i class="bi bi-info-circle"></i> Dưới 80% màu xanh · từ 80% màu vàng · từ 100% màu đỏ.</p>
  </main>
</div>
</body>
</html>